"title": "阿摩司書 1:1–2:16",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "30001001-30002016",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108562\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">阿摩司</data>宣講了針對<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108479\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">北國</data>周圍列國的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108534\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">審判的信息</data>，這些信息以<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108204\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">詩歌</data>的形式被紀錄了下來。這些詩歌是關於<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108434\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">大馬士革</data>的<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108540\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">亞蘭人</data>、<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108267\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">非利士人</data>和<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108475\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">泰爾</data>的居民，以及<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108411\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">以東人</data>、<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108412\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">亞捫人</data>、<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108397\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">摩押人</data>和<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108480\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">南國</data>的居民的。這些民族的土地位於一個圓圈中，北國位於這個圓圈的中心。接著，阿摩司談到了<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108199\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">神</data>也將對北國進行<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108233\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">審判</data>。</p>",
